From: Xun2202 <98207886+Xun2202@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 16:54:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] library: add a panorama compact grid display mode

Wide covers in the compact grid stretch every row to the tallest cell
because the title is drawn on the cover. CompactGridPanorama keeps that
overlay and, like the panorama comfortable grid, draws a cover as 3:2
when its height/width is at most 0.75, in a staggered grid whose
automatic columns are 168 dp. Cover orientation stays cached for the
process lifetime so a cell keeps its shape after it scrolls away.

The mode serializes as COMPACT_GRID_PANORAMA and has a branch at every
LibraryDisplayMode site: the library pager, library settings (directly
after the compact grid), browse content, and the browse toolbar (the
same ViewCompact icon, with the menu item directly after compact grid).

Harmony-only: paired with the same CompactGridPanorama mode being added on Anikku; Animeko has no such grid.
